                        "glosses": [
                            "A stoneware jug of a pattern that originated around Cologne, Germany, in the 16th century, having a bearded face or mask supposed to represent Cardinal Bellarmine, a leader in the Counter-Reformation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
