                                "sense_id": "e514b503-7ad2-3ec4-9c83-52b0681338dc",
                                "text": "A bellarmine found in Westminster, which, when found, was corked up, and in it were found some old pins and rusty nails; it had been probably used in the art of Black Magic."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
